{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-822fe8d1-76f9-4190-8498-2791a08ed39d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8bce5ce10dd237e1","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/h5/l8qslbp55w5621qf9ngsh5jc0000gn/T/epic-RHAISTRAT-9018-oj_aquik/artifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9018-E003.md","content":"# Administrator view of current-month consumption against Kueue quota\n\n## Description\n\nThis epic delivers the Dashboard administrator view showing each project's\ncurrent-month GPU-hour consumption alongside that project's Kueue GPU quota,\nso administrators can see how much of each project's quota has been consumed\nthis month. It consumes two existing capabilities rather than re-implementing\nthem: the per-project consumption reporting delivered for chargeback\nreporting, and the per-project Kueue GPU quota data exposed by the\nDistributed Workloads component.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Administrator view in the Dashboard listing projects with their\n  current-month GPU-hour consumption and their Kueue GPU quota, presented as\n  a consumption-vs-quota comparison.\n- Reuse of the per-project report capability for the current-month\n  consumption figures (current month is a fixed time range of the same\n  report data) — no independent consumption-data retrieval.\n- Reuse of the per-project quota data surface exposed by the Distributed\n  Workloads component for the quota figures — no independent quota\n  computation.\n- Administrator-only access.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- The administrator view shows, per project, current-month GPU-hour\n  consumption alongside the project's Kueue GPU quota.\n- Consumption figures come from the chargeback reporting capability and\n  quota figures from the exposed per-project quota data; neither is\n  re-implemented in this epic.\n- Projects without a Kueue quota are presented predictably rather than\n  silently omitted.\n- View access is restricted to platform administrators.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-3 (P1) — the Dashboard admin view shows current-month consumption\n  against each project's Kueue quota.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":55674,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-913a72913d7c060a","agent_id":"a7ae081040d55e322","session_id":"bb15c9ed-6003-4c9d-b6c4-e899274a0ed5","uuid":"e22b6b2c-8aa1-4355-966f-4ee7781afd70","timestamp":"2026-10-26T20:37:22.702Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9018"}
