 Reuse of the per-project quota data surface exposed by the Distributed\n52\t  Workloads component for the quota figures — no independent quota\n53\t  computation.\n54\t- Administrator-only access.\n55\t\n56\t## Acceptance Criteria\n57\t\n58\t- The administrator view shows, per project, current-month GPU-hour\n59\t  consumption alongside the project's Kueue GPU quota.\n60\t- Consumption figures come from the chargeback reporting capability and\n61\t  quota figures from the exposed per-project quota data; neither is\n62\t  re-implemented in this epic.\n63\t- Projects without a Kueue quota are presented predictably rather than\n64\t  silently omitted.\n65\t- View access is restricted to platform administrators.\n66\t\n67\t## HLR Traceability\n68\t\n69\t- HLR-3 (P1) — the Dashboard admin view shows current-month consumption\n70\t  against each project's Kueue quota.\n71\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-99932b429b3b4205","agent_id":"aef7897d48a8721f5","session_id":"bb15c9ed-6003-4c9d-b6c4-e899274a0ed5","uuid":"08a1b61b-c512-490a-b267-21077080d2e0","timestamp":"2026-10-26T20:39:40.304Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9ae06b781a68049b","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9018 decomposition"}
